MODULE: CheckOmitsNewTree
TARGET: TruthfulCreate
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the admission checks the old count without charging this create
PERTURBS: CheckCreate

--- FIND
         IF Cardinality(owned) + 1 <= Effective THEN "admitted" ELSE "refused"]
--- REPLACE
         IF Cardinality(owned) <= Effective THEN "admitted" ELSE "refused"]
--- END
